Removed the duplicate GraphQL registration on Ticket Update, Ingestion Stats and LLM Usage Record, which carried both the `graphql` extras feature and an explicit GraphQL type for the same model.
Moved six imports from internal Nautobot paths to the `nautobot.apps.*` public API, and noted the one deliberate internal import that has no public equivalent.
Set `author_email`, `min_version` and `max_version` on the app configuration, so Nautobot checks the supported version range at startup rather than leaving it to the packaging pin.
Moved the filterset and model test suites onto Nautobot's own test base classes, which added generic filter coverage the app's hand-written tests did not have.
